From c0773a323e17bf21ef22137de129990ac6f3b498 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: benma's agent <benma-agent@bitbox.swiss>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 00:03:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] antiklepto: validate ECDSA signatures

Use shared compact and recoverable ECDSA validators for direct
signing responses and from inside Anti-Klepto verification. Reject
malformed scalars, high-S encodings, and recovery IDs outside the
secp256k1 range before accepting signatures.

Accept recovery IDs 0..3 for all recoverable ECDSA signatures.
Add regression tests and prepare Rust 0.13.1 release metadata.
